codex
One audit point mattered before freezing G4: independently choosing which clause vertex to omit would exaggerate hardness. Once a variable assignment is guessed, completing all satisfiable clause gadgets is mechanical. I’m tightening the measured candidate language to one deterministic completion per assignment, so the real structure-aware search space is \(2^{24}\), not \(2^{24}3^{96}\). The shipping guess probability still passes, but for the right reason.
apply patch
