-
-## Caveats
-
-The polynomial annotation intentionally makes this a Track-B family: a CAS or
-128 Horner evaluations solves it quickly.  The guess probability is uniform
-over size-`n` field subsets after enforcing connector, shape, ordering, and
-distinctness; it is not a model of guesses biased by the polynomial.  The panel
-does not include a full ILP/SAT solver or a specialized minimum-vertex-cover
-implementation, although the polynomial reference algorithm is strictly enough
-to solve every generated instance.  Canonicalization is exact for input reorder
-and the family's global field-translation symmetry; it is not a complete
-canonical labeller for arbitrary uncoloured graph isomorphism because the field
-tags are semantic vertex data.  Most importantly, no oracle-hardness claim is
-made until the missing bare, hinted, and placebo runs complete successfully.
