Implemented a graph-native Track B generator based on Section 2, Theorem 4 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.08050).

Local verification results:

- G1–G8 pass.
- Structure-aware guesses: 0/200,000; exact density \(2^{-24}\).
- Four heuristic attacks: 0/8 each.
- Gaussian and DPLL references: 8/8.
- Compact route: 119 XOR operations.
- Shipping answer: 217 elements, 1,002 characters.

